@startuml Tokens Overview
actor User
participant Browser
participant MobileApp
participant nginx
participant oauth2Proxy
participant RevocationSvc
participant Keycloak
participant Backend

User -> Browser : Login
Browser -> nginx : / (auth_request -> oauth2Proxy)
User -> MobileApp : Login
MobileApp -> Keycloak : PKCE auth / store tokens

note right of oauth2Proxy
  oauth2-proxy stores session + tokens in Redis
end note

Browser -> nginx : API request (session cookie)
nginx -> oauth2Proxy : auth_request -> returns access token
nginx -> Backend : forward with X-Access-Token

MobileApp -> nginx : API request (Authorization: Bearer)
nginx -> Backend : forward with Authorization header

== Logout branching ==
Browser -> nginx : POST /auth/logout (per-session)
nginx -> RevocationSvc : delete that session
MobileApp -> nginx : POST /auth/logout?global
nginx -> RevocationSvc : delete all sessions 
@enduml